/E (Thank you for having an interest or passion in serving the next generation of future leaders and disciples of Jesus. Here at City UTH, our mission and vision is to make disciples of Jesus through fellowship and fun! We strive to create an environment of community, spiritual growth, and prayer. We want to see the next generation set on fire for Jesus through the power of His presence and we want to help equip them to impact the community around them.)
