/T (OUTINGS)
/E (OUTINGS)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
327 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (City Uth takes outings once a month on the LAST Friday of every month. The purpose of these outings is to bond together as a youth group through fun activities/trips. Examples are going out to an arcade, going to the beach, going to a retreat, etc. On outings, we do need chaperones to attend; this includes city Uth leaders scheduled for that Friday. On each outing, each chaperone will be assigned a group of students that they are responsible for during the outing. )
/Alt ()
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [6 7]
>>
endobj
328 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
