/T (FUNDRAISERS)
/E (FUNDRAISERS)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
329 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (City Uth hosts fundraisers every year to help students raise money for youth events, such as Youth Convention, Fine Arts Festival, and Summer Camp. We host multiple different fundraisers so no student has a financial barrier keeping them from going to these events. For these fundraisers, we require involvement from parents and all City Uth Leaders. These fundraisers may include car washs, bake sales, babysitting services, providing to-go meals, etc. During the planning and execution of these fundraisers, our purpose is to serve our community and work together, in unity, to reach our financial goal together.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [9]
>>
